{
  "storyId": "B-5d18",
  "name": "fix-validate-suite-hang",
  "title": "Fix validate-suite hang: a hung mutating smoke silently force-exits validate and blocks every story DONE",
  "description": "Two validate.commands smokes (review-pass-discard-smoke, init-window-data-loss-smoke) hang with no output for 300s, tripping the validate watchdog which force-exits the whole suite WITHOUT re-stamping test-evidence.materialHash. That makes the DONE Evidence-freshness gate impossible to pass, blocking EVERY story DONE (observed blocking B-4033). Fix the hang and make validate robust so one stuck command fails loudly instead of silently nuking the suite.",
